{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to be overtaken by wrath and sorrow \u2013 sacrificing your very souls to break the cycle. Embrace the torment in the Y9S3 Battle Pass, unlocking 100 tiers of rewards for all 37 heroes, each tier bearing the weight of your haunted legacy, including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-1 Execution (per hero)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-1 Weapon Set (per hero)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-1 Paired Emote (per hero)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-2 Battle Outfits (per hero)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-2 Effects (idle/emote/execution per hero)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Various customization elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A 10% bonus in battle points earned through completed matches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-And more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The For Honor Y9S3 Battle Pass offer does not add any new benefits to the game if you already own the Y9S3 Battle Bundle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Y9S3 Battle Pass is available until December 2, 2025, and is not eligible for refund.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3887980?t=1757596361","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3887980?t=1757596361","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887980/b748a435bdbc0e6d1570ab205516066a3a3d2089/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757596361","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887980/b748a435bdbc0e6d1570ab205516066a3a3d2089/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757596361","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"descript